00:00:31,280 --> 00:00:31,937
an API.

13
00:00:32,883 --> 00:00:35,593
In such a case, we would have a standalone

14
00:00:35,866 --> 00:00:38,640
frontend application and frontend simply

15
00:00:38,656 --> 00:00:41,527
means running on the device your users are

