00:00:55,831 --> 00:00:58,701
for, typically built with a framework like

23
00:00:58,781 --> 00:01:00,497
Angular, React, Vue, and so on.

24
00:01:01,284 --> 00:01:04,463
Now these kinds of apps run on the frontend,

25
00:01:04,656 --> 00:01:07,482
so they run on the device of your user.

26
00:01:08,109 --> 00:01:10,277
In the case of an app, it's obvious it's a

27
00:01:10,293 --> 00:01:13,071
mobile app installed from the App Store, and

28
00:01:13,087 --> 00:01:16,042
therefore the app itself is responsible for

29
00:01:16,042 --> 00:01:18,563
