00:06:58,376 --> 00:07:01,389
And frontend and backend here form one unit.

159
00:07:01,886 --> 00:07:03,668
Everything is managed by one server.

160
00:07:04,310 --> 00:07:07,151
Now traditionally, if we go back like 10

161
00:07:07,263 --> 00:07:07,568
years,

